# --- Model weights and caches (never commit) ------------------------------
# Exception: models/acoustic_probe.npz (~50 KB) is a locally fitted linear head,
# not a Hub checkpoint. Versioned on purpose so a clone reproduces the measured
# numbers without re-running training; see report Appendix A.
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.h5
*.ckpt
*.msgpack
.huggingface/
.cache/
models/*
!models/acoustic_probe.npz
checkpoints/

